---
description: Swipefile setup and integration work, follow the hard rules in AGENTS.md
alwaysApply: true
---

When setting up this project or wiring integrations (Supabase, Stripe, Meta,
PostHog, Foreplay), follow the hard rules in AGENTS.md at the repo root. Key
points: never commit .env or any key; DB_SERVICE_KEY never reaches the browser
or a static host; Supabase "Allow new users to sign up" stays off; every
integration is optional, so only wire what the person actually has. The app's
/setup page reports what is missing. Human docs: README.md and docs/SETUP.md.
